WEBVTT

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:03.000
A balanced model begins with two octane molecules.

00:00:03.000 --> 00:00:06.000
2 C₈H₁₈ + 25 O₂ → 16 CO₂ + 18 H₂O.

00:00:06.000 --> 00:00:09.000
Both sides contain C 16, H 36 and O 50.

00:00:09.000 --> 00:00:12.000
Pump gasoline is a blend, not pure octane.
